    "Apple Intelligence readiness comments need a supported device with Apple Intelligence turned on in Settings. Body's built-in explanation is shown instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tagesform-Kommentare von Apple Intelligence erfordern ein unterstütztes Gerät, auf dem Apple Intelligence in den Einstellungen aktiviert ist. Stattdessen wird die integrierte Erklärung von Body angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence readiness comments need a supported device with Apple Intelligence turned on in Settings. Body's built-in explanation is shown instead."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los comentarios de Apple Intelligence sobre tu preparación requieren un dispositivo compatible con Apple Intelligence activado en Ajustes. Mientras tanto, se muestra la explicación integrada de Body."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les commentaires d’Apple Intelligence sur la préparation nécessitent un appareil compatible sur lequel Apple Intelligence est activé dans Réglages. L’explication intégrée de Body s’affiche à la place."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence की रेडिनेस टिप्पणियों के लिए ऐसा समर्थित डिवाइस चाहिए जिसकी सेटिंग में Apple Intelligence चालू हो। इसकी जगह Body की अपनी व्याख्या दिखाई जाती है।"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для комментариев Apple Intelligence о готовности нужно поддерживаемое устройство, на котором Apple Intelligence включен в Настройках. Вместо них показывается встроенное пояснение Body."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Intelligence hazırlık yorumları için desteklenen bir aygıt ve Ayarlar'da açık olan Apple Intelligence gerekir. Bunun yerine Body'nin yerleşik açıklaması gösterilir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple 智能恢复状态点评需要支持该功能的设备，并在设置中开启 Apple 智能。否则将显示 Body 自带的说明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
